  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a ttukbaegi or heavy pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the caraway seeds and allspice and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken legs and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the wine, broth, ketchup, vinegar, sugar, parsley, black pepper, and salt.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the chicken is cooked through, about 30 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, with crusty bread and a side of saut\b6rd potatoes, if desired.",
    "Strain the sauce and discard the solids, if desired.",
    "Serve the sauce over the chicken and enjoy!",
    "Serve in copper-mugs for a unique presentation, if desired."
